Package: fastPLSextra
Type: Package
Title: Iterative Solver Companion for fastPLS
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: person("Stefano", "Cacciatore", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "tkcaccia@gmail.com")
Description: A focused GPL-licensed comparison implementation for the
    manuscript's nuclear magnetic resonance benchmark. It fits CPU
    double-precision SIMPLS or PLS-SVD with IRLBA while reusing the optimized
    native PLS engines exported by fastPLS. Cross-validation and standalone
    singular value decomposition interfaces are intentionally excluded.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.6.0)
Imports: Rcpp, Matrix, stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo, Matrix, fastPLS (>= 0.99.40)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: yes
